{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37179","headline":"过洞庭 · 李屿","name":"过洞庭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩渺注横流，千潭合万湫。\n半洪侵楚翼，一汊属吴头。\n动轴当新霁，漫空正仲秋。\n势翻荆口迮，声拥岳阳浮。\n远脉滋衡岳，微凉散橘州。\n星辰连影动，岚翠逐隅收。\n渐落分行鴈，旋添趁伴舟。\n昇腾人莫测，安稳路何忧。\n气与尘中别，言堪象外搜。\n此身如麤了，来把一竿休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李屿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}